[{"answer":"Ah... come in, Russ.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Now you wanted to consult me about your class presentation on nanotechnology -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/3.mp3"},{"answer":"you're due to give it in next week, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right. And I'm really struggling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I chose the topic because I didn't know much about it and wanted to learn more,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/6.mp3"},{"answer":"but now I've read so much about it, in a way there's too much to say -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I could talk for much longer than the twenty minutes I've been allocated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Should I assume the other students don't know much, and give them a kind of general introduction,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/9.mp3"},{"answer":"or should I try and make them share my fascination with a particular aspect?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/10.mp3"},{"answer":"You could do either,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but you'll need to have it clear in your own mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I think I'll give an overview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/13.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, one way of approaching this is to work through developments in chronological order.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/15.mp3"},{"answer":"On the other hand, you could talk about the numerous ways that nanotechnology is being applied.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/16.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean things like thin films on camera displays to make them water-repellent,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and additives to make motorcycle helmets stronger and lighter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Or another way would be to focus on its impact in one particular area,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/20.mp3"},{"answer":"say medicine, or space exploration.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/21.mp3"},{"answer":"That would make it easier to focus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps I should do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that would be a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/25.mp3"},{"answer":"How important is it to include slides in the presentation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/26.mp3"},{"answer":"They aren't essential, by any means.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's a danger of tailoring what you say to fit whatever slides you can find.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/28.mp3"},{"answer":"While it can be good to include slides,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/29.mp3"},{"answer":"you could end up spending too long looking for suitable ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/30.mp3"},{"answer":"You might find it better to leave them out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Another thing I was wondering about was how to start.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I know presentations often begin with","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/34.mp3"},{"answer":"'First I'm going to talk about this, and then I'll talk about that',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/35.mp3"},{"answer":"but I thought about asking the audience what they know about nanotechnology.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/36.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be fine if you had an hour or two for the presentation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/37.mp3"},{"answer":"but you might find that you can't do anything with the answers you get,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and it simply eats into the short time that's available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So, maybe I should mention a particular way that nanotechnology is used, to focus people's attention.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/40.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds sensible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/41.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think I should do next?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I really have to plan the presentation today and tomorrow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, initially I think you should ignore all the notes you've made,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/44.mp3"},{"answer":"take a small piece of paper, and write a single short sentence that ties together the whole presentation:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/45.mp3"},{"answer":"it can be something as simple as 'Nanotechnology is already improving our lives'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Then start planning the content around that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/47.mp3"},{"answer":"You can always modify that sentence later, if you need to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/48.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/49.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, now let's think about actually giving the presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/50.mp3"},{"answer":"You've only given one before, if I remember correctly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/51.mp3"},{"answer":"about an experiment you'd been involved in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/53.mp3"},{"answer":"It was pretty rubbish!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's say it was better in some respects than in others.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/55.mp3"},{"answer":"With regard to the structure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I felt that you ended rather abruptly, without rounding it off.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Be careful not to do that in next week's presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/58.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/59.mp3"},{"answer":"And you made very little eye contact with the audience,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/60.mp3"},{"answer":"because you were looking down at your notes most of the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/61.mp3"},{"answer":"You need to be looking at the audience and only occasionally glancing at your notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Your body language was a little odd.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Every time you showed a slide, you turned your back on the audience so you could look at it -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/64.mp3"},{"answer":"you should have been looking at your laptop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/65.mp3"},{"answer":"And you kept scratching your head,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/66.mp3"},{"answer":"so I found myself wondering when you were next going to do that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/67.mp3"},{"answer":"instead of listening to what you were saying!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh dear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/69.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you think of the language?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I knew that not everyone was familiar with the subject,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/71.mp3"},{"answer":"so I tried to make it as simple as I could.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that came across.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/73.mp3"},{"answer":"You used a few words that are specific to the field,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/74.mp3"},{"answer":"but you always explained what they meant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/75.mp3"},{"answer":"so the audience wouldn't have had any difficulty understanding.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I must say the handouts you prepared were well thought out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/77.mp3"},{"answer":"They were a good summary of your presentation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/78.mp3"},{"answer":"which people would have been able to refer to later on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/79.mp3"},{"answer":"So well done on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I hope that helps you with next week's presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it will. Thanks a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/83.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll look forward to seeing a big improvement, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-3-2023-03-11-20-36-09/84.mp3"}]
